<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - LTA half yr EPS, div rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - LTA half yr EPS, div rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline		107	   vs 89</p>
<p>    - net		     103	   vs 90</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 25	    vs 20</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts polled had forecast earnings between 107.0 and 110.0 cents a share with consensus at 108.3 cents. They expected the dividend to come in at around 24.0 cents from 20.0 before.  </p>
<p>    Net earnings	    29.18	 vs 25.24</p>
<p>    Tax			 20.89	 vs 15.30</p>
<p>    Interest received     4.01	  vs 1.48 paid</p>
<p>    Turnover		  1,513.00    vs 1,344.00</p>
<p>    Depreciation provided 51.77	 vs 35.77</p>
<p>    Div payable September 12</p>
<p>    on register August 8</p>
<p>    Full name: LTA Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
